{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.AppendixSurreals.collatz_vtwo_cycle_descent","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.collatz_vtwo_cycle_descent","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.LaurentTwoValuation"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.laurentTwoVal_descends_on_cycle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.laurentTwoVal_descends_on_cycle","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/collatz_vtwo_cycle_descent.lean#L42-L51","doc":"**`v_[2]` strictly descends at the fundamental cycle (sorry-free).**  The even\nbranch sends the non-attractor point `1+q⁻¹` to the attractor `q⁻¹`, and\n`v_[2]` drops from `1` to `0`.  So `v_[2]` satisfies the strict-descent\ncondition on the fundamental cycle (descent required only off the attractor)\n— corroborating, with the out-of-cone rescope, that `v_[2]` is a live descent\ncandidate on `D∞`.  Not a closure. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.cycle_even_step","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.cycle_even_step","kind":"theorem","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/collatz_vtwo_cycle_descent.lean#L35-L39","doc":"**Even-branch step of the fundamental cycle (sorry-free).**  `q⁻¹·[2]_q =\n1+q⁻¹`: the even branch `P ↦ P/[2]_q` sends `1+q⁻¹ ↦ q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}